   sibling AutomationListItem model. The prompt path is the generator's canonical alias for it.
2. Navigation: the web /automations/list is a sub-route co-existing with the card hub
   /automations (AutomationsListPage). Following the dominant repo convention (web sub-routes like
   /admin/audit-log become top-level AppRoute cases + a path alias), it is registered as a top-level
   .automationsList AppRoute (pathSegment "automations-list") with a /automations/list deep-link
   alias, and wired into the shell's route host in TeslaSyncApp (real, reachable navigation — not a
   dead destination). The web name-link (/automations/{id}) and empty CTA (/automations/new) target
