   (masterState / master checkbox); the declarations use selectAll* (web symbol cited in comments).
5. Supporting bulk strings: the web <BulkActionToolbar> count/clear/aria labels (bulk.selected,
   bulk.ofTotal, bulk.clear, bulk.toolbarLabel) are added as localized keys so the toolbar holds
   ZERO hardcoded literals — additive, beyond the 22 required parity strings.

